## App-Schluessel (Z1): Werte NIE im Repo
Config/AppKeys.local.xcconfig

# Python bytecode from the repo tooling (8c50ff4)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# SQLite side files a hand-opened fixture leaves behind; the readers open immutable
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

